{
  "name": "followup-24h (Gatilho 4)",
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "name": "A cada hora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "name": "Buscar leads sem compra >24h",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "#1 Antes so filtrava por ultima_interacao, e nada marcava o envio: o mesmo lead recebia template TODA HORA, para sempre -- 24/dia, o suficiente para derrubar a qualidade da conta e levar a banimento. Agora exige consentimento (#4, compliance secao 5), teto de 2 follow-ups por lead, e intervalo minimo de 48h entre eles. O 'or' com is.null cobre quem nunca recebeu (#13: 'lt' nao casa NULL).",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://rmvmqmcfcjmcjtonewgi.supabase.co/rest/v1/leads?status=in.(ativo,abandonou)&consentimento_contato=eq.true&followups_enviados=lt.2&ultima_interacao=lt.{{new Date(Date.now()-24*60*60*1000).toISOString()}}&or=(ultimo_followup_em.is.null,ultimo_followup_em.lt.{{new Date(Date.now()-48*60*60*1000).toISOString()}})",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "9XxwNt8U6u5tce4w",
          "name": "SUPABASE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n2b",
      "name": "Separar leads (1 item cada)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Transforma o array unico em N itens n8n, um por lead, para os proximos nodes rodarem por item automaticamente.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const leads = $input.first().json || [];\nreturn leads.map(l => ({ json: l }));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n4",
      "name": "Gravar evento (follow-up)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://rmvmqmcfcjmcjtonewgi.supabase.co/rest/v1/conversas",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { lead_id: $json.lead_id, etapa_processo: 'recuperacao', desfecho: 'follow_up_agendado' } }}",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "9XxwNt8U6u5tce4w",
          "name": "SUPABASE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3p",
      "name": "Preparar template de follow-up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Fora da janela de 24h so um template aprovado reabre a conversa. O template precisa ter EXATAMENTE uma variavel no corpo (o nome) e existir em pt_BR -- ver ../../whatsapp/README.md secao 9.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return [{ json: { to: $json.lead_id, tipo: 'template', template_nome: '<<WHATSAPP_TEMPLATE_NAME>>', template_idioma: 'pt_BR', template_params: [$json.nome || ''] } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n3x",
      "name": "Enviar template de follow-up",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Chama sub-enviar-whatsapp. Selecione o sub-workflow no dropdown apos importar -- o ID nao viaja entre instancias.",
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "G1sbNfyXXIwL3Cmh",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "sub-enviar-whatsapp (sub-workflow)"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "n5",
      "name": "Marcar follow-up enviado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "#1 Sem este passo o lead volta a casar na query na hora seguinte. Incrementa via RPC-livre: le o valor atual do proprio item.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "PATCH",
        "url": "=https://rmvmqmcfcjmcjtonewgi.supabase.co/rest/v1/leads?lead_id=eq.{{$json.lead_id}}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { ultimo_followup_em: new Date().toISOString(), followups_enviados: ($json.followups_enviados || 0) + 1 } }}",
        "options": {},
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "9XxwNt8U6u5tce4w",
          "name": "SUPABASE"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
